e>std.crypto.pbkdf2.maxInt</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L3\">第 3 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/math/#std.math.maxInt\"><code>std.math.maxInt</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.pbkdf2.mem\"><h3><code>std.crypto.pbkdf2.mem</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L2\">第 2 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/#std.mem\"><code>std.mem</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.pbkdf2.OutputTooLongError\"><h3><code>std.crypto.pbkdf2.OutputTooLongError</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L4\">第 4 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/errors/#std.crypto.errors.OutputTooLongError\"><code>std.crypto.errors.OutputTooLongError</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.pbkdf2.pbkdf2\"><h3><code>std.crypto.pbkdf2.pbkdf2</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L53\">第 53 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>应用 PBKDF2 从密码生成密钥。</p>\n<p>PBKDF2 定义于 RFC 2898，并为 NIST SP 800-132 所推荐。</p>\n<p>dk：用于存放生成密钥、大小适当的切片，通常长 16 或 32 字节。\n可以未初始化；所有字节均会被覆写。\n最大大小为 <code>maxInt(u32) * Hash.digest_length</code>。\n传入长度超过此上限的缓冲区属于编程错误。</p>\n<p>password：任意长度的字节序列，可以为空。</p>\n<p>salt：任意长度的字节序列，可以为空。常见长度为 8 字节。</p>\n<p>rounds：迭代次数，必须大于 0。常见取值范围为 1,000 至 100,000。\n增大迭代次数会增加计算\ndk 所需的时间，从而提升安全性。通常调整此参数，使计算耗时约 100ms。</p>\n<p>Prf：使用的伪随机函数。常见选择为 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/hmac/#std.crypto.hmac.sha2.HmacSha256\">std.crypto.auth.hmac.sha2.HmacSha256</a></code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">pbkdf2</span>(dk: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, password: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, salt: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, rounds: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> Prf: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) (<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/errors/#std.crypto.errors.WeakParametersError\">WeakParametersError</a> || <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/errors/#std.crypto.errors.OutputTooLongError\">OutputTooLongError</a>)!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>dk: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>password: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>salt: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>rounds: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre>\n<pre><code>Prf: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.pbkdf2.std\"><h3><code>std.crypto.pbkdf2.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">第 1 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.crypto.pbkdf2.WeakParametersError\"><h3><code>std.crypto.pbkdf2.WeakParametersError</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L5\">第 5 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/errors/#std.crypto.errors.WeakParametersError\"><code>std.crypto.errors.WeakParametersError</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>源码</summary><p><code>std/crypto/pbkdf2.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1